  "details": "Description\n\nI am currently on Linux, I can’t solve a problem, no matter the distribution or the version of proton.\n\nI’m joining the Fish world and my graphics card is going back and forth regarding its use, causing saccades with regular intervals in games.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nYou just have to join the world, even at spawn and whether it’s in desktop or VR, it still happens .\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3p2-1921-15c4a824b2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-28_17-13-35.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_40a44847-56f1-4913-a7f6-dcc35fb98751/1/file)",
